<header class="thought-heading">
<h1>Thought experiments &amp; metaphors</h1>
<p class="thought-lede">Five thinkers. Twenty-eight ways to test an idea.</p>
<p>Compare what each image makes visible about human nature, learning, government, or knowledge. Follow a passage link to read the argument in context.</p>
</header>
